# Keep the build context minimal: only go.mod/go.sum + cmd/ + internal/, the
# attribution files and scripts/collect-licenses.sh are COPY'd into the image.
# Everything else (VCS history, review/CI scratch, docs, tests, and any local
# secrets) must never enter the build context.
.git
.github
.code-review
.judgement
.refactor
.steering-maintenance
docs
tests
# ...except the build-time smoke test, which the Dockerfile test stage runs
# in-image (the runtime image-smoke harness files above it stay excluded).
!tests/smoke.sh
*_test.go
*.md
# ...except the attribution file the builder stage copies into the image's
# /usr/share/licenses tree (LICENSE and NOTICE carry no excluded extension).
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
compose.yaml
.env
*.env
secrets
dumps
.pgpass
